{"seq":2,"slug":"time-series-conformal","title":"时序共形","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/conformal-prediction-uncertainty/practice/time-series-conformal","wordCount":1371,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"时序共形\">时序共形</h1><p>时间序列是 CP 的天敌：它天然有序，今天依赖昨天，把它打乱就毁掉了预测信息——可交换从根上就不成立，连 <a href=\"distribution-shift\">加权共形</a> 的&quot;找个正确权重&quot;也救不了持续演化的漂移。时序共形的破局思路是彻底换赛道：放弃&quot;在静态校准集上取一次分位数&quot;，转而<strong>在线</strong>地、随每个新观测到来不断调整。本篇汇集 ACI、EnbPI 等 2025–2026 年时序 CP 的主流方法谱系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>时序 CP 的统一思想是：把&quot;目标覆盖&quot;或&quot;残差池&quot;当成一个<strong>随时间更新的状态</strong>，而非一次算定的常数。根据更新对象的不同，主流方法分四族——加权 CP（重加权校准残差）、EnbPI（刷新残差池）、ACI（在线调目标覆盖）、Block CP（按块切分）。其中 ACI 与 EnbPI 是工程上用得最多的两个。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[时间序列 不可交换] --&gt; B{在线调整什么?}&#10;  B --&gt;|目标覆盖率| C[ACI&lt;br/&gt;按近期覆盖误差更新 alpha_t]&#10;  B --&gt;|残差池| D[EnbPI&lt;br/&gt;自助集成 滚动刷新残差]&#10;  B --&gt;|校准权重| E[加权 CP&lt;br/&gt;指数衰减偏向近期]&#10;  B --&gt;|时间块| F[Block CP&lt;br/&gt;按块保留局部结构]&#10;  C --&gt; G[长期覆盖收敛到 1-alpha]&#10;  D --&gt; G\">flowchart TD\n  A[时间序列 不可交换] --&gt; B{在线调整什么?}\n  B --&gt;|目标覆盖率| C[ACI&lt;br/&gt;按近期覆盖误差更新 alpha_t]\n  B --&gt;|残差池| D[EnbPI&lt;br/&gt;自助集成 滚动刷新残差]\n  B --&gt;|校准权重| E[加权 CP&lt;br/&gt;指数衰减偏向近期]\n  B --&gt;|时间块| F[Block CP&lt;br/&gt;按块保留局部结构]\n  C --&gt; G[长期覆盖收敛到 1-alpha]\n  D --&gt; G</pre><h2 id=\"aci-把覆盖率当控制问题\">ACI：把覆盖率当控制问题</h2><p>自适应共形推断（Adaptive Conformal Inference，Gibbs &amp; Candès 2021）是时序 CP 最优雅的思路：它不假设分布，而是把&quot;达到目标覆盖&quot;当成一个<strong>在线控制问题</strong>。维护一个随时间变化的有效错误率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，每步根据上一步是否覆盖来更新它——若上一步漏覆盖（区间太窄），就调低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 让下一个区间变宽；若过度覆盖（区间太宽），就调高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 收紧。更新规则是简单的梯度式步进：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>err</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha_{t+1} = \\alpha_t + \\gamma \\left( \\alpha - \\text{err}_t \\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">err</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>err</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{err}_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">err</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是上一步是否漏覆盖（0 或 1），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span> 是学习率。这个机制的妙处在于：无论分布如何漂移，长期平均覆盖率被<strong>保证</strong>收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>——它不要求可交换，只要求你愿意接受&quot;任意单步可能偏、但长期收敛&quot;。代价是单个时刻的区间宽度会随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 波动，且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span> 需调（大 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span> 反应快但抖，小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span> 平滑但跟漂移慢）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"enbpi-用集成刷新残差池\">EnbPI：用集成刷新残差池</h2><p>EnbPI（Ensemble Batch Prediction Intervals，Xu &amp; Xie 2021，发表于 ICML 并扩展至 IEEE TPAMI）走另一条路：用自助（bootstrap）集成训练多个模型，对每个时间点用&quot;没在训练中见过它&quot;的那些模型算留一式残差，构成一个<strong>滚动刷新</strong>的残差池，再取分位数得区间。它不重训单个大模型、不切固定校准集，而是让残差池随时间窗口滚动，自然适应渐变漂移。后续的 SPCI（Sequential Predictive Conformal Inference）进一步对残差分位数做时间自适应再估计，改进了 EnbPI 在快速漂移下的表现（见 <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2601.18509\">arXiv 时序 CP 基准</a>）。下表对比三族主流方法。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>在线更新对象</th>\n<th>覆盖保证</th>\n<th>计算代价</th>\n<th>适用漂移</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>加权 CP（指数衰减）</td>\n<td>校准残差权重</td>\n<td>近似</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>温和、缓变</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ACI</td>\n<td>目标错误率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>长期均值收敛</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>任意、含突变</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EnbPI / SPCI</td>\n<td>滚动残差池</td>\n<td>近似</td>\n<td>中（集成）</td>\n<td>渐变</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BC-ACI（2026）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> + 每步偏差修正</td>\n<td>长期收敛、多步更稳</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>多步预测</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"2026-年的前沿-多步-变点与稳健化\">2026 年的前沿：多步、变点与稳健化</h2><p>时序 CP 在 2025–2026 仍是活跃前沿，三条线值得知道。其一，<strong>多步预测</strong>：BC-ACI（Bias-Corrected ACI，2026）给每个预测时域加在线指数加权的偏差估计，先修正不符合度再算分位，显著改善多时域预测的稳定性（见 <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/html/2604.13253\">arXiv BC-ACI</a>）。其二，<strong>变点感知</strong>：针对序列中突然的结构断裂，专门的变点共形方法在断点后快速重置校准，避免旧分布的残差污染新区间。其三，<strong>稳健化</strong>：Wasserstein 正则、最优传输等针对非可交换流数据的稳健 CP（见 <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/html/2606.15953\">arXiv 漂移感知谱共形</a>）。这些工作的共同主题是：时间维度上的不可交换不是要不要面对，而是用在线、滚动、自修正的机制把覆盖保证从&quot;严格但脆弱&quot;换成&quot;长期且稳健&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与时序建模-漂移的边界\">与时序建模、漂移的边界</h2><p>时序 CP 是给<strong>时序模型</strong>套的不确定性外壳，它不替代时序建模本身——ARIMA、指数平滑、深度时序模型仍负责产生点预测，CP 只在其上加区间，建模部分属于 <a href=\"../time-series-analysis/ts-models/arima-models\">时间序列分析</a> 的范畴。与上一篇 <a href=\"distribution-shift\">加权共形</a> 的边界也要分清：加权 CP 修的是&quot;一次性、可估计的协变量漂移&quot;，时序 CP 修的是&quot;持续、随时间演化、形式未知的漂移&quot;——前者静态、后者动态，时序场景几乎总该用后者。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>时间序列天然不可交换（顺序携带信息），静态 CP 与加权 CP 都不够，时序 CP 改用在线、滚动机制。</li>\n<li>ACI 把覆盖当在线控制问题，按上一步是否漏覆盖梯度式更新 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，长期平均覆盖<strong>保证</strong>收敛 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>，不需可交换。</li>\n<li>EnbPI/SPCI 用自助集成的滚动残差池适应渐变漂移；BC-ACI（2026）加每步偏差修正改善多步预测。</li>\n<li>2026 前沿：多步预测、变点感知、Wasserstein/最优传输稳健化。</li>\n<li>时序 CP 是时序模型的不确定性外壳，不替代建模；与加权 CP 的边界是&quot;动态演化漂移 vs 一次性协变量漂移&quot;。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>一次性协变量漂移的静态修复，对照本篇动态解：<a href=\"distribution-shift\">分布漂移与加权</a></li>\n<li>为何序列天然违反可交换：<a href=\"../foundations/exchangeability\">可交换性假设</a></li>\n<li>产生点预测的时序模型本体：<a href=\"../time-series-analysis/ts-models/arima-models\">ARIMA 模型</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"时序共形","id":"时序共形"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"ACI：把覆盖率当控制问题","id":"aci-把覆盖率当控制问题"},{"level":2,"text":"EnbPI：用集成刷新残差池","id":"enbpi-用集成刷新残差池"},{"level":2,"text":"2026 年的前沿：多步、变点与稳健化","id":"2026-年的前沿-多步-变点与稳健化"},{"level":2,"text":"与时序建模、漂移的边界","id":"与时序建模-漂移的边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"分布漂移与加权","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/conformal-prediction-uncertainty/practice/distribution-shift"},"next":{"title":"落地与边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/conformal-prediction-uncertainty/practice/conformal-in-practice"}}